  "correct": "2",
  "solution": "We substitute the values in the given equation and solve it using BODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/b2f64c9f79d77b59f47195df405b394d1389881df31e18c68888ff4c37e1e42e.png] \n\nOption 1) +, -, +, +, = \n\n__**467 + 231**__ - 123 __**+ 789 + 345**__ = 131 \n\n__**1832 - 123**__ = 131\n\n1709 ≠ 131\n\nOption 2) +, -, -, +, =\n\n__**467 + 231**__ - 123 - 789 __**+ 345**__ = 131\n\n__**1043 -**____** 123 -**____** 789**__ = 131 \n\n131 = 131\n\nOption 3) +, -, ×, +, =\n\n467 + 231 - __**123 × 789**__ + 345 = 131\n\n__**467 +**____** 231**__ - 97047 __**+**____** 345**__ = 131\n\n__**1043 - 97047**__ = 131\n\n-96004 ≠ 131\n\nOption 4) ×, -, -, +, =\n\n__**467 × 231**__ - 123 - 789 + 345 = 131\n\n__**107877**__ - 123 - 789 __**+ 345**__ = 131\n\n__**108222 -**____** 123 -**____** 789**__ = 131\n\n107310 ≠ 131\n\nHence, **the correct answer is option 2).**",
